---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import JsonLd from '~/components/JsonLd.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Our Matchmaking Process',
  description:
    'A clear explanation of how The Matchmaking Bureau gets to know each person, considers compatibility and supports private introductions.',
};

const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Service',
  name: 'Private Matchmaking Process',
  provider: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: 'The Matchmaking Bureau',
    url: 'https://matchmakingbureau.com',
  },
  areaServed: ['Philippines', 'Thailand', 'Indonesia', 'Malaysia', 'Singapore', 'Vietnam'],
  description:
    'A personal, patient and handpicked matchmaking process for discerning people seeking a serious relationship.',
  serviceType: 'Private Matchmaking',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <JsonLd data={schema} />
  <main transition:animate="fade" class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-24 md:py-32">
    <header class="mb-20 text-center">
      <p
        class="mb-6 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#eac290]"
        style="font-family:'Newsreader',serif;"
      >
        Private Matchmaking
      </p>
      <h1 class="mb-8 text-4xl leading-tight text-white md:text-7xl" style="font-family:'Noto Serif',serif;">
        Our Matchmaking Process
      </h1>
      <p
        class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-xl italic leading-relaxed text-[#9b8f82] md:text-2xl"
        style="font-family:'Newsreader',serif;"
      >
        Personal, patient and handpicked.
      </p>
    </header>

    <article
      class="space-y-16 border-y border-[#4e453b] py-16 text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#d2c4b7] md:text-xl"
      style="font-family:'Newsreader',serif;"
    >
      <section class="space-y-6">
        <p>
          Our matchmaking process is personal, patient and handpicked. We do not search a database, run people
          through a checklist and send out profiles. Our team speaks with people, gets to know them and uses
          experience and personal judgment to decide who may genuinely suit each other.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-3xl text-[#eac290]" style="font-family:'Noto Serif',serif;">We Take Time to Understand You</h2>
        <p>
          Before we think about an introduction, we want to understand you properly. Our team communicates with you
          and tries to understand what kind of person you are, where you are in life, what you are looking for and
          what really matters to you in a relationship.
        </p>
        <p>
          This can take time, and that is intentional. We would rather be patient than rush an introduction simply
          because someone looks suitable on paper.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-3xl text-[#eac290]" style="font-family:'Noto Serif',serif;">We Look Beyond the Profile</h2>
        <p>
          When considering someone for you, we pay close attention to honesty, intentions and whether the person is
          genuinely serious about finding a life partner.
        </p>
        <p>
          We also look beyond what is written in the application. Two people can match perfectly on a checklist and
          still not be right for each other. Experience, judgment and understanding the person behind the profile are
          an important part of how we choose potential matches.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-3xl text-[#eac290]" style="font-family:'Noto Serif',serif;">Before an Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          If we believe someone may be suitable for you, our team will communicate with you first. You may have
          questions about the person, and we will answer what we reasonably can while respecting everyone's privacy.
        </p>
        <p>
          There is no need to rush. We want both people to have enough understanding and comfort before an
          introduction takes place.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-3xl text-[#eac290]" style="font-family:'Noto Serif',serif;">When We Feel the Introduction Is Right</h2>
        <p>
          We make an introduction when we believe there is enough potential for two people to genuinely explore the
          connection.
        </p>
        <p>
          Once introduced, we ask both people to be patient with each other and give the connection a fair chance. We
          also prefer to focus on one introduction at a time rather than creating unnecessary distractions with several
          people at once.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-3xl text-[#eac290]" style="font-family:'Noto Serif',serif;">We Stay Involved</h2>
        <p>Our involvement does not end when we introduce two people.</p>
        <p>
          People can be shy. They can overthink. Sometimes there are questions someone does not feel comfortable
          asking directly, or a small misunderstanding can become much bigger than it needs to be.
        </p>
        <p>
          Past relationships and previous experiences can also affect the way someone sees a new situation. We stay
          available to listen, answer questions and help both people communicate more clearly.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our role is not to interfere with the relationship. It is to support the introduction and give two people the
          best opportunity to understand each other properly.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-6">
        <p>
          There is no fixed formula for finding the right person. Every person and every relationship is different.
          That is also why our matchmaking process is different for each person.
        </p>
        <p class="text-2xl italic text-[#eac290]">
          We take the time to understand you, carefully consider the people we introduce, and let the relationship
          develop naturally from there.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>

    <section class="py-20 text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl text-white md:text-5xl" style="font-family:'Noto Serif',serif;">
        Begin with a confidential application
      </h2>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-block bg-[#cda777] px-8 py-5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#573c15] transition-all hover:bg-[#eac290] md:px-12 md:tracking-[0.3em]"
        style="font-family:'Noto Serif',serif;"
      >
        Apply Now
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
